03", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_774312788169636_8407136546126498352_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VSwwpgH-37IQ7kNvwGDKfYv&_nc_oc=AdpAJ61c4-RoBQYlL_QMD04eMAtWuUv1PF8hnv0hVIjavx7jLCIcgNGLhbsLWViU39Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0KNiHhBqQNnvIcYMuzkYolbIkgf_PUlHNAxj3eVcy6Cg&oe=69EF5926"}]}, "id": "1377969980485338", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SC26.png", "id": "964420118677466", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_964420125344132_7279037948266946186_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FQGUpwKFEL0Q7kNvwHE0Num&_nc_oc=Adqs6ejbEHGY5JOudZohex3qPzVC7vvm_srPQ96q3MuOZWEsYgiJjvwCrr33ulz8sUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3pyOGWaPGayMGa8bbWwcZSHJb3R-3yERqNVpplBWpcHQ&oe=69EF6445"}, {"file_name": "SC19.png", "id": "1028550412168366", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031459_1028550415501699_7667063941983084531_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ADjgcwIssYYQ7kNvwHcNBeT&_nc_oc=AdoF7ON9EVyJvoiHWXaOXUEIWtssf1tQDJ5cf3TABQxr4Q4QfByv0n0LtmOAvR0zSn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3-96YlWO2QP0tsQV1easf7oCgWMK5xa2c8JWC4lHFJ2g&oe=69EF61EC"}, {"file_name": "SC6.png", "id": "1213008986735069", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_1213008990068402_721949442093583782_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vGUfTwnVHVMQ7kNvwHFO3uv&_nc_oc=Adq6oZNnICxDbgX8WTuLirjy-hnOnHWXO5yc5Qrk7oQh9fdHorPAuNFABCX-cRxm5dU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3ZvOtuSavwq0MyBYLRPbTdRlQhoNkFxMDjNyXoJuR6BA&oe=69EF75A0"}, {"file_name": "SC25.png", "id": "2182709462063835", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_2182709465397168_1136481695964559917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZO5Ra1egxKkQ7kNvwHa3zJV&_nc_oc=AdqIb-RBtXwULpMpaUEXug_6Koz7QhwIIMc140y-4FlWBtwkBnhFNg9aD7EPgzX9oJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1jeRj1pu1mytcwvMm2DjatmFfyxVJyktrw2qsZANIsiw&oe=69EF6AB6"}, {"file_name": "SC11.png", "id": "1020526033014243", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250452_1020526036347576_3573329723363051043_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BJ7gL3qFQXcQ7kNvwG3L7p_&_nc_oc=AdrpLXDzqWfbb08tg7eRYm66LGy6YrsrthkDatJ6bD9BQCthO9Q_7PgRGOpbp1FObE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af12W1kmpzPm5aYTC5mvzQmeTYR8Ih6BVQxAIVo2c2pV_A&oe=69EF602F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "1670277503511368", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974650_1670277506844701_2413630122857125207_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RZxOvhAKAy8Q7kNvwG_4z52&_nc_oc=AdrISh9y1J5eI4orJSjMmH2t_h8bQZnDHhx9aUY913UBdTXafg9ELoiaPow52r1PNzo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af118gwMdxd-yX_C3lZso6_9wJB4NJDQWsKWrK3NpGl8vw&oe=69EF70D5"}, "display_name": "Venture's Gauntlet: Ultimate VR Fitness", "keywords": ["fitness", "adventure", "obstacle", "story", "platformer"], "long_description": "# VR's Ultimate Action-Platformer\n\nObsessed with his family's legacy, aging billionaire Adam Venture is looking for a capable heir to the Venture name and fortune. His only requirement? The skill and tenacity to overcome a series of deadly obstacle courses known as: **Venture\u2019s Gauntlet**\n\n{960204795511693}\n\n# Comfortable Locomotion \n\nRun, climb, swing and zipline your way through the gauntlet in comfort and style with **TrueMotionVR** arm swing controls.\n\n\n# Overcome Dangerous Challenges\n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive.\n\n{472666925095689}\n\n# Embark On An Epic Journey\n\nTraverse giant cliffs, delve into the depths of the earth and climb crumbling castles across 9 intense stages inspired by the Highlands of Scotland.\n\n{2173852816328585}\n\n# Breathtaking Visuals\n\nExperience beautiful graphics powered by Unreal Engine. A dynamic time of day and weather system makes the world feel alive as you progress through the Gauntlet.\n\n{408266168650091}\n\n# Uncover the secrets of the Ventures\n\nThe ever-present Adam Venture watches your every move. Do you have the skill to impress him, or will you be a disappointment like all the others?\n\n{1446632349279537}\n\n# Tailor Made Courses\n\nCalibration adjusts the Gauntlet\u2019s obstacles to your height & arm length measurements to ensure the best experience for all users.\n\n# Claim the ultimate glory\n\nCompete against other players for the best times on each stage on the online leaderboards.\n\nSo ask yourself this -  do **YOU** have what it takes to run the Gauntlet?\n\nWe think you can do it!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Venture\u2019s Gauntlet is an intense parkour & obstacle course game that features arm swing movement, climbing, archery, moving lasers, shooter drones, shields, and more.  \n\nPlaying the game is an immersive physical experience, a test of both fitness and skill because you are the one running, climbing, and dodging through challenging courses!  \n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive and claim Adam Venture's fortune.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "BearHammer Games Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id"